  "summary": "Fresno police used automated license plate readers to locate a carjacking victim's stolen vehicle and later a vehicle associated with two suspects in Stockton. Deshawn Lamar Price and Praya Briann Smith were arrested and extradited back to Fresno.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Fresno police used an Automated License Plate Reader (ALPR) to locate the victim's car. Days later, on October 7, officers used the technology to find the suspects' vehicle in Stockton.",
